  sources:
  - name: Stationary final-energy defaults
    authority: Kausal
    description: "Municipal geography is as of 31 December 2024. 2023 stationary sector
      totals and grid deliveries converted to sector-by-carrier defaults using the
      same Mainz 2018 prior as load_bisko_demo. Electricity uses grid deliveries;
      the remainder uses the prior's other-carrier proportions. Municipalities where
      any sector has grid deliveries exceeding its total stationary energy are excluded
      entirely: 123 excluded, 3530 eligible. Cells are synthetic estimates; source
      and prior hashes and upstream estimation details are retained in provenance.
      RLP calibration transfer and within-association allocations are unvalidated;
      empirical ranges describe upstream quantities, not carrier-cell confidence intervals."
    target: dataset
